{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 63940, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 46865, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "浅谈PVP刀卡选择", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1608183537, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1611043269, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 20, "status": 1, "summary": "结合日服领先国际服一年的PVP环境来看，个人推荐投资3体2连刀而不选择2体3连刀。原因如下：（评价仅针对大毕业环境下的5U阵容）日服目前常见的PVP刀卡只有3位：伊芙轮子光土星这3位无一例外全都是3体", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608183180588_5097706.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608183176089_57054181.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 7, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 13050, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 63940, "content": "<span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"padding: 0pt; margin: 0pt; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; text-indent: 0pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">结合日服领先国际服一年的</font>PVP环境来看，个人推荐投资3体2连刀而不选择2体3连刀。</span></span></span></b><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 8pt;\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"padding: 0pt; margin: 0pt; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; text-indent: 0pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 8pt;\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">原因如下：</span></font></span><b style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">（评价仅针对大毕业环境下的</font>5U阵容）</span></b><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></font></span></p><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">日服目前常见的</font>PVP刀卡只有3位：伊芙 轮子 光土星</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">这</font>3位无一例外全都是3体刀，而同样作为6连的菩萨 火伞 普巴 则是出场率惨淡，我认为原因都是出在了2体的技能目标上。</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">原因一：第二轮SS伤害溢出。</span></font></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">首先</font>PVP角色点火必备红防御词条，毋庸置疑，对伤害减免的效果明显。而在红防御词条的基础上最佳的是什么？是红攻击词条，同样对伤害有大幅度的增加。这就导致在PVP毕业5U环境下，大家的伤害和肉度都有质的提升。这直接导致在练度接近的两位玩家的战斗，第一轮技能很难做到直接减员<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">（说的就是你，2体3</span></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">连刀</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">）</span></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">，这就意味着2轮SS技能才能造成减员。而2体3连刀这种目标少，伤害集中的问题就提现出来了。大家都是2轮技能杀人，你只能击杀2位天子，而第二轮技能的伤害大部分打在了残血角色上造成伤害溢出一大半，而3体2连刀的伤害则是正好造成敌人3位减员，差距一下就拉开了。</span></p></span></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">原因二：与干扰的联动。</span></font></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">日服从蒙眼实装开始进入新生代干扰的强势期，配队大环境变为干扰</font>+刀+-cd角色</span>，并且所有人权干扰角色无一例外都是点火变为3体debuff。相应的也需要搭配3体刀来进行配合，和2体刀的联动效果极差。此外我还要引入一个新概念：<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">收割型干扰。</span></span></p></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></p><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608183176089_57054181.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608183176089_57054181.png\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; width: 651.496px; height: 426px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608183180588_5097706.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608183180588_5097706.png\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; width: 654.63px; height: 401px;\"></div></span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline;\">蒙眼，幻影丽莎</span>，都是带有超高伤害的点火</font>3体干扰，我把她们称为收割型干扰。都可以配合刀卡进行快速减员，取得胜利。<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-weight: bold;\">大家可能都有一个误区就是：我要靠刀卡打输出并且完成击杀，3体2连刀伤害不够秒人。这种想法其实在5U环境下变得不那么正确，其实2体3连刀在没有辅助的情况下依然无法秒人。个人认为：在人人红攻点火的情况下，完成击杀是一件很容易的事，并不一定交给刀来做，刀的唯一职责就是大面积（指多体）压血，营造出敌人多个残血的残局，再来由上面提到的收割型干扰，来清理残局。这些干扰不仅ss白值伤害高，还带有dot伤害，有效的克制鲜花的不死Buff，是收割人头的绝佳人选，而刀卡带有dot伤害的不多，如果打在不死上面是很大的隐患。</span></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; text-decoration-line: underline;\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-weight: bold;\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></font><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">为什么不选择</font>4体刀呢？</span></span></span>答案很简单，伤害过于分散，并且总伤害低于6连刀。</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">如果说</font>3体2连可以制造3个50%血，那么4体刀只能制造4个70%血，效果极差。</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></font><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">综上所述：我建议各位将钻石投入</font>3体2连的PVP6连刀。</span></span></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 176, 240); font-weight: bold;\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">关于</font>2体3连刀，她们并不弱，只是有一点，配队要保证你的SS第一轮就能造成减员，大家应该都猜到了，应该搭配什么角色。没错就是增伤辅助：梅芙 泡面 鲁邦等等。配队有局限性，和辅助绑定，这也是为什么我不推荐2体3连刀的原因。（双刀三刀邪教也可以玩）</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-size: 12pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><o:p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></o:p></span></p><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\